abstract: "One aggregation contract across Pandas, Polars, MapReduce and PySpark;
saturation-curve budget allocation via water-filling; and a sentiment bridge from
the Raye multilingual sentiment corpus (210,511 comments) that adjusts platform
budget factors with empirical-Bayes shrinkage."
